#: ../../changelog/firmware/v4.5.6.rst:152
msgid "``image.unpack()`` removed — use ``to_ndarray()`` *(major)*"
msgstr "``image.unpack()`` borttagen — använd ``to_ndarray()`` *(major)*"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v4.5.6.rst:154
msgid ""
"The short-lived ``image.unpack()`` was removed; convert an image to a tensor"
" with ``image.to_ndarray(dtype, buffer=...)`` instead, and apply scale/mean/"
" stdev normalization with :class:`ml.preprocessing.Normalization` rather "
"than the old built-in image-scaling path."
msgstr ""
"Den kortlivade ``image.unpack()`` togs bort; konvertera istället en bild "
"till en tensor med ``image.to_ndarray(dtype, buffer=...)``\\ , och tillämpa "
"scale/mean/stdev-normalisering med :class:`ml.preprocessing.Normalization` "
"istället för den gamla inbyggda bildskalningsvägen."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v4.5.6.rst:159
msgid ""
"*Commits:* `9848eed12 "
"<https://github.com/openmv/openmv/commit/9848eed12>`__, `de0d46fa6 "
"<https://github.com/openmv/openmv/commit/de0d46fa6>`__"
msgstr ""
"*Commits:* `9848eed12 "
"<https://github.com/openmv/openmv/commit/9848eed12>`__\\ , `de0d46fa6 "
"<https://github.com/openmv/openmv/commit/de0d46fa6>`__"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v4.5.6.rst:165
msgid "``Image()`` raw-array ``scale`` argument *(minor)*"
msgstr "Råa-array-argumentet ``scale`` i ``Image()`` *(minor)*"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v4.5.6.rst:167
msgid ""
"When constructing an ``Image`` from a raw pixel array, the ``scale`` "
"argument now takes a ``(min, max)`` range instead of ``(scale, add)``."
msgstr ""
"När en ``Image`` konstrueras från en rå pixelarray tar argumentet ``scale`` "
"nu ett ``(min, max)``\\ -intervall istället för ``(scale, add)``\\ ."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v4.5.6.rst:170
msgid ""
"*Commit:* `7b79fb4c7 <https://github.com/openmv/openmv/commit/7b79fb4c7>`__"
msgstr ""
"*Commit:* `7b79fb4c7 <https://github.com/openmv/openmv/commit/7b79fb4c7>`__"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v4.5.6.rst:175
msgid "Haar cascades disabled by default on most boards *(behavior)*"
msgstr ""
"Haar-kaskader inaktiverade som standard på de flesta kort *(behavior)*"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v4.5.6.rst:177
msgid ""
"To free flash space, Haar-cascade face detection (``find_features()`` / "
":func:`image.HaarCascade`) is now disabled by default on Arduino GIGA, Nicla"
" Vision, Portenta H7, OpenMV 3, OpenMV 4 / 4 Plus / PRO, and OpenMV Pure "
"Thermal. Scripts using Haar cascades on those boards must rebuild the "
"firmware with the feature enabled."
msgstr ""
"För att frigöra flashutrymme är Haar-kaskadbaserad ansiktsdetektering (\\ "
"``find_features()`` / :func:`image.HaarCascade`\\ ) nu inaktiverad som "
"standard på Arduino GIGA, Nicla Vision, Portenta H7, OpenMV 3, OpenMV 4 / 4 "
"Plus / PRO och OpenMV Pure Thermal. Skript som använder Haar-kaskader på "
"dessa kort måste bygga om firmware med funktionen aktiverad."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v4.5.6.rst:183
msgid ""
"*Commit:* `6ce27c910 <https://github.com/openmv/openmv/commit/6ce27c910>`__"
msgstr ""
"*Commit:* `6ce27c910 <https://github.com/openmv/openmv/commit/6ce27c910>`__"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v4.5.6.rst:188
msgid "Script interruption and tensor scaling *(behavior)*"
msgstr "Skriptavbrott och tensorskalning *(behavior)*"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v4.5.6.rst:190
msgid ""
"The USB debugger now interrupts a running script via MicroPython's VM-abort "
"feature instead of a forced PendSV jump (cleaner, but the interruption point"
" differs). The ``SCALE_S128_127`` input scaling was corrected to map 0–255 "
"to −128–127 without an erroneous gain — models relying on the old "
"(incorrect) scaling will produce different results."
msgstr ""
"USB-felsökaren avbryter nu ett körande skript via MicroPythons VM-abort-"
"funktion istället för ett påtvingat PendSV-hopp (renare, men avbrottspunkten"
" skiljer sig). Indataskalningen ``SCALE_S128_127`` korrigerades till att "
"mappa 0–255 till −128–127 utan en felaktig förstärkning — modeller som "
"förlitar sig på den gamla (felaktiga) skalningen ger andra resultat."

